      "revision": "0.1",
      "author": "Ivan",
      "date": "12-Oct-26",
      "reviewed_by": "",
      "description": "Initial draft of F1 Get Data based on discussion rules GD-01 to GD-11. F2 Cancel Sync, F3 PO Mapping and F4 Case Assignment are documented separately."
    }
