          "ORDER_DT"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "constraints": [
      "Insert only: quantity changes in H0202 for a key that already exists are ignored; corrections are injected manually outside this batch (GD-07, GD-11).",
      "F1 does not check pcs/case multiples. The hold for non-multiple quantities is done in F3 per ORDER_DT + DESTINATION_CD + PART (GD-09).",
      "SERIAL_NO is not used (GD-06).",
      "Table names TB_R_CI_PENDING_ORDER_DT and TB_R_CI_BATCH_LOG and the column SPLIT_SEQ are proposed; align them with the project naming convention."
    ]
  },
